    <string name="no_permission_title">No permissions needed</string>
    <string name="no_permission_body">Sutra never asks for a permission. Everything here uses signals Android gives every app. On Android 13+ the status notification stays hidden unless you allow notifications yourself in system settings — the service runs either way, and you can always stop it here, from the Quick Settings tile, or from Settings → Apps → Active apps. On Xiaomi, Oppo, Vivo and some Samsung phones, setting Sutra\'s battery use to “Unrestricted” keeps it more reliable.</string>
